proof. by proc*; call (FPB._sqrmU__ll (<: M(P).P_FPB) P_FPB_muln_ll P_FPB_sqrn_ll P_FPB_red_ll P_FPB_muln_h P_FPB_sqrn_h P_FPB_red_h). qed.

hoare _addm__h _p _a _b:
